.TH rayscan-db-intel 1  "intel " 
.SH NAME
rayscan\-db\-intel \- Download and index the full CISA KEV catalog and current EPSS scores
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBintel\fR [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Download and index the full CISA KEV catalog and current EPSS scores
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Re\-download feeds even when the cached copy is fresh
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit the refresh summary as JSON
.TP
\fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress progress output
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
